% Bibliography for the varimpact package.
%
% Surnames with particles are brace-protected, e.g. {van der Laan}. Without
% the braces BibTeX treats "van der" as a middle name and citeproc renders the
% author as "Laan, Mark J. van der", citing him as "(Laan 2007)". Most of the
% methodology this package implements is his, so that matters here.
%
% Every entry carries a doi, each one looked up and checked against Crossref
% rather than written from memory. readme.csl deliberately does not render
% the DOI as a trailing link; pandoc's link-bibliography then hyperlinks the
% entry's title to it instead, so a title with no link means a missing doi.
%
% Referenced from readme.Rmd, and available to Rd files via Rdpack.

